  "title": "How to Make Bordelaise Sauce",
  "description": "A simpler bordelaise sauce made with red wine, caramelized shallots, and real veal stock. This French sauce is delicious on steak, or any roast meat.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
